      "reconstructed_text": "And at the time when it generated its own self [f]rom the fruits through its offspring, they fell upon the earth and [drew] strength from the elements and were nourished by them. [All] wickedness, together with cruelty [was gathered] in the ruler, the leader of all the demons. He hum[bled] his worlds and his powers; he gathered them all into him. He made himself ready for the battle; he set himself to the war with that light earth, and the great King who dwells in it."
